                                                "sense_id": "d50efd6a-29aa-3fed-ae1c-4ae7fbf8d32f",
                                                "text": "[…]By this scimitar,\nThat slew the Sophy and a Persian prince\nThat won three fields of Sultan Solyman,\nI would outstare the sternest eyes that look,\nOutbrave the heart most daring on earth,\nPluck the young sucking cubs from the she-bear,\nYea, mock the lion when he roars for prey,\nTo win thee, lady. […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dbd4f7be-6470-3cc2-9bd4-fd5149ca2218",
                                        "entry_id": "17f2f78f-b437-3a49-abe6-08d36a349d33",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Racy; sexually provocative."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
